# Upload and manage files (specs/002-manage-server-files US2): a write whose answer is lost is kept as "Outcome unknown", no run repeats it, and the
# user decides after "Check the server". Run after 03-upload-and-manage.walk (Auto Sync is off by then) with the same server and folders.
# server lose-next-answer PUT zlast
size 1404 1872
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeFiles
waitfor folderRow
tap folderAdd
wait 500
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor pickerPath
tap pickerTile 0
wait 700
tap pickerTile 4
expect pickerSelection 1 file(s)
tap pickerUpload
waitfor dialogText in the queue
tap footerButton 0
tap folderQueue
waitfor queueRow
expect queueRowCaption Not synced
tap queueSend
waitfor queueRowCaption Outcome unknown
shot @OUT@/47-queue-unknown.png
tap queueRow 0
tap queueResolve
waitfor choiceRow
shot @OUT@/48-queue-unknown-choices.png
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor dialogText It is on the server
shot @OUT@/49-queue-check-result.png
tap footerButton 1
waitfor queueRowCaption Sent
shot @OUT@/50-queue-marked-done.png
tap queueBack
wait 600
